\b Internet Uptime Tracker\b0\par
\par
This software is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. It installs two local Windows services: one that monitors internet connectivity and writes an outage log, and one that serves the dashboard at http://127.0.0.1:8787.\par
\par
The dashboard and services run locally on this computer. No usage data is sent anywhere.\par
\par
Existing outage history in D:\InternetUptimeTracker is copied into C:\ProgramData\InternetUptimeTracker on first start. The original folder is left untouched.\par
\par
Click Next to continue.\par
